Found on a bunch of Green Onions I bought at the Fairway Market on Quadra. Unless I’m mistaken this is either a new introduced species to BC from the east or a new introduced species to North America from Asia. Potentially the latter as that supermarket carries largely Asian products and I don’t know if that extends to produce but I’ll try to inquire.

@ceiseman can you weigh in? I have specimens if you want me to collect for barcoding / can go back

@oneofthedavesiknow I think this is up your alley

observation is for prey item

for robber fly, see:

https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/343378438

On Ambrosia monogyra. 
